{"4450010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stickman 3D Wingsuit DELUXE", "steam_appid": 4450010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450010/extras/13e0d9ffb94fd49dcab7963e75aaec6f.poster.avif?t=1776360099\" width=500 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450010/extras/13e0d9ffb94fd49dcab7963e75aaec6f.webm?t=1776360099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450010/extras/13e0d9ffb94fd49dcab7963e75aaec6f.mp4?t=1776360099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a stickman wingsuit pilot! Fly through beautiful 3D levels and avoid deadly lava, spikes and saw blades. Remember to open up your parachute! Skydiving as a stick man has never been so bloody and deadly! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450010/extras/ead9faf86f137106f8bfb14cc5197196.avif?t=1776360099\" width=403 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through various mission types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score - Get the highest score by flying close to the ground and doing tricks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waypoints - Travel through a needed amount of waypoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turrets - Drop grenades on turrets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel Distance - travel a specific distance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450010/extras/32d7a9555cbee0488b358e727ca6cd6f.poster.avif?t=1776360099\" width=500 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450010/extras/32d7a9555cbee0488b358e727ca6cd6f.webm?t=1776360099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450010/extras/32d7a9555cbee0488b358e727ca6cd6f.mp4?t=1776360099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450010/extras/f7633f6f8f842267bd485e7e50e539c4.avif?t=1776360099\" width=403 height=111 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revamped flight physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced &quot;Deluxe&quot; Graphics for WIndows, Mac and Linux!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Keyboard input, gamepad and touch control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like skydiving and base jumping this game is for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a real stickman!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450010/extras/13e0d9ffb94fd49dcab7963e75aaec6f.poster.avif?t=1776360099\" width=500 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450010/extras/13e0d9ffb94fd49dcab7963e75aaec6f.webm?t=1776360099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450010/extras/13e0d9ffb94fd49dcab7963e75aaec6f.mp4?t=1776360099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></